    "backstory": "Once a celebrated blues musician, 'String Plucker' lost everything when the Great Liquidity Crash turned Subchain City into a dust bowl. Now, haunted by Dead-Eyes and the ghost of his former glory, he wanders the wastes, strumming his Red Feather Strat for scraps and DRIP.",
